      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like they should include 2 mirror prefabs for \"High\" and \"Low\" so we can decide which one we want to use without having to change a bunch of settings. And possibly a warning in the SDK that mentions using the \"Low\" prefab if its a performance heavy world.",
