  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently when you set up a mirror in a world all the layers a selected to render in that  mirror by default. This has led to many beginner worlds having horribly unoptimized mirrors. This prefab should instead only have the default, player, and mirror reflection layers setup by default.",
